        "testata": "France 24",
        "lingua_originale": "en",
        "titolo_orig": "France examines bill to rein in ultra-fast-fashion's expansion",
        "testo_it": "Il governo francese esamina un disegno di legge per limitare l'espansione dell'ultra-fast-fashion.",
        "priorita": "Bassa",
        "id_gruppo": 9,
        "link": "https://www.france24.com/en/france-examines-bill-to-rein-in-ultra-fast-fashion-s-expansion",
        "orario": "17:14",
        "timestamp": 1781709284,
        "contenuto_esteso": "To display this content from YouTube, you must enable advertisement tracking and audience measurement. One of your browser extensions seems to be blocking the video player from loading. To watch this content, you may need to disable it on this site. France examines bill to rein in ultra-fast-fashion's expansion France Issued on: 17/06/2026 - 17:14 Here in Paris, Chinese fast-fashion brand Shein is leaving the iconic BHV department store in the chic Marais neighbourhood. The departure follows months of controversy over its inclusion at the landmark shop - with critics accusing Shein's low-cost, high turnover business model of destroying French retail, and high-end brands like Dior and Guerlain abandoning BHV. A French parliamentary committee begins on June 17 an examination of a proposed law to rein in the expansion of ultra-fast fashion. What is France hoping for by inviting Trump to have dinner in Versailles? 17/06/2026 Europe Iconic Paris canal opens to swimmers as residents seek ways to cope with heatwave 17/06/2026 France Ahead of Trump's dinner at Versailles, a look at its previous guests over the decades 17/06/2026 France After a long wait, JR's Pont Neuf installation opens to the public 17/06/2026 France Paris's BHV ends short but controversial partnership with Shein 17/06/2026 France Paris's largest outside swimming pool opens early ahead of massive heatwave 17/06/2026 France JR's \"The Cave\" on Paris' Pont Neuf is finally open to the public 16/06/2026 France France's 'culture of rape must become culture of protection', campaigner says 11/06/2026 France 2026 World Cup: France team arrives on US soil 11/06/2026 Americas"
